factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the rally was held in 'கோவை ஆர் எஸ் புரம்' / 'கோவை ஆர்.எஸ்.புரத்தில', and the slides_spec says 'ஆர்.எஸ்.புரம், கோவை'; the article only says the RS Puram police (ஆர்.எஸ்.புரம் போலீசார்) organized it, which is a police station area, so the location is a reasonable reading, but the caption's '📍' footer aside, the caption states the rally was 'ஏற்பாடு செய்தனர்' (organized) by police, which the article supports only as participation ('ஈடுபட்டனர்'), not organization.
  The reel_script states 'பள்ளி ஆசிரியர்களும் இந்த பேரணியில் நடந்தனர்' and the caption says teachers 'மாணவிகளுடன் நடந்தனர்' – the article only lists teachers as participants, not specifically as walking with students; minor overstatement.
  The reel_script says Inspector Sivakumar 'இங்கு வந்து இருந்தார்' and the reel and slides describe him as a participant; the article lists him among participants, which is consistent, but the caption's claim that Assistant Commissioner Chellathurai and Inspector Sivakumar 'கலந்து கொண்டனர்' is fine – no issue beyond the above.
